WEBVTT

00:00:03.213 --> 00:00:09.748
A contact's activities page lists the scheduled activities, which can be completed, edited

00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:12.471
or purged, and the completed ones.

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:16.146
A completed activity shows who dispositioned it:

00:00:16.146 --> 00:00:19.073
a person, the dialer, or an AI agent.

00:00:19.524 --> 00:00:25.333
Purge takes a scheduled activity out of the work for good, and it cannot be undone.

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:30.424
The activity is kept with the status Purged, and who purged it and when.

